      {
         "id": "SECTION_introduction",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Introduction\n\nEvery text in History Tracers follows a consistent structure. Understanding this layout makes reading easier, because you will always know where to find the recommendations, the main content, the sources, and the activities. This guide describes each part of a page.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_general",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### General section\n\nThe general sections form the main body of the page. Each one has a title and develops a part of the subject, with explanations, examples, images, and tables. They follow a logical order, progressing from foundational concepts to more complete discussions.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_conclusion",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Conclusion\n\nThe conclusion closes the text. It summarizes the main ideas and, when appropriate, invites the reader to continue with the next content.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_exercise",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Exercise\n\nSome pages finish with an exercise. This gives you the opportunity to practise what you have just read and check your understanding through questions and activities.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_families",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Families\n\nFamily pages in the *Genealogy* section are unique. In addition to the sections described above, they contain an internal book about the family, with its own indexes and navigation. This book lets you browse the family history page by page, from the earliest mentioned ancestors to the most recent generations appearing on the page.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      }
